      "id": "DB-MIGRATION-DECLARATIONS",
      "source_contract_or_required_gap": "Recursive29-document/28-edge/20-changeSet candidate graph; initial pgcrypto declaration/UUID defaults, later representation/project/library/identity migrations. No extension installation or DB execution authority follows.",
      "native_state": "UNPORTED"
    },
    {
      "id": "DB-RESOURCE-SELECTION",
      "source_contract_or_required_gap": "Transactional persist snapshots current resource list before filters/conversion to avoid concurrent proxy-load additions; only EMF resource scheme passes and all persistence filters must accept. Migration predicates use anyMatch; invalid editing-context UUID or non-EMF input skips document update.",
      "native_state": "UNPORTED"
    },
    {
      "id": "DB-RESOURCE-SERIALIZATION",
      "source_contract_or_required_gap": "ResourceToDocument configures EObjectIDManager/schema location/listener and optional migration processor/extended metadata. Save warnings/errors are logged; IllegalArgumentException/IOException becomes Optional.empty. Metadata defaults empty name/false readOnly; invalid resource UUID gets random UUID. Default string decoding charset and EMF JSON runtime remain unqualified.",
      "native_state": "UNPORTED"
    },
    {
      "id": "DB-READONLY-PRESERVATION",
      "source_contract_or_required_gap": "Persistence layer reuses an already-persisted same-ID read-only document when new document is read-only and existing version also read-only. Otherwise uses newly converted document. This is separate from model aggregate reconciliation.",
      "native_state": "UNPORTED"
    },
    {
      "id": "DB-DOCUMENT-RECONCILIATION",
      "source_contract_or_required_gap": "SemanticData.updateDocuments compares ID/name/content, reuses identical existing instances/timestamps, rebuilds changed same-ID documents with name/content only, accepts new documents, and detects removals by ID set. isReadOnly is not part of sameContent comparison; do not invent flag preservation.",
      "native_state": "UNPORTED"
    },
    {
      "id": "DB-DOMAIN-METADATA",
      "source_contract_or_required_gap": "Domain URIs are replaced in doUpdateDocuments only when document content/name/new-ID/removal triggers shouldBeUpdated. Domain-only changes are not independently sufficient in this candidate source; source quirk must be qualified.",
      "native_state": "UNPORTED"
    },
    {
      "id": "DB-DEPENDENCY-EVENTS",
      "source_contract_or_required_gap": "Add dependencies filters IDs already present and emits event/time change only if new entries exist; removal path emits event/time change even when no entry removed. Update service finds existing aggregate then invokes update and saves; missing aggregate is no-op in inspected service.",
      "native_state": "UNPORTED"
    },
    {
      "id": "DB-TRANSACTION-REPOSITORY",
      "source_contract_or_required_gap": "Repository query/identity/constraint/optimistic-concurrency/domain-event publication and actual Spring transaction/serialization effects remain required unresolved contracts. Local Rust snapshots do not implement this store.",
      "native_state": "UNPORTED"
    },
    {
      "id": "DB-FAILURE-RECOVERY-ROLLOUT",
      "source_contract_or_required_gap": "Connection interruption, migration failure/retry/checksum history, crash recovery/backups/restore, full-state round trips, crossproject isolation and upgrade/rollback require isolated real execution and reviewed authority; open crosslinks to API/HISTORY/RECOVERY/DEPS do not remove DB obligations.",
      "native_state": "UNPORTED"
    }
